<workout_file><author>mywhooshinfo.com</author><name>5min Max Aerobic</name><description>By working just above Threshold in Zone 4 and into Zone 5, we can improve our VO2max abilities and increase our Threshold. These are high-intensity efforts, so the intervals are broken down into shorter work periods. 

A well developed VO2max system will allow you to recover from high-intensity efforts faster and increase endurance.</description><sportType>bike</sportType><workout>
